      "explanationZhHans": "由递推式 a_{n+1} = 2a_n + 3^n，两边同除以 2^{n+1} 得 a_{n+1}/2^{n+1} = a_n/2^n + (3/2)^n / 2。累加得 a_n/2^n = 1/2 + Σ_{k=1}^{n-1} (3/2)^k / 2 = (3/2)^n - 1，故 a_n = 3^n - 2^n。"
